These counts are based on the eap-release directory. This directory holds the earlier boundaries described in the technical note, shared through the Early Adopters Program in late 2025 and organised by model (including the only published TrazoSA output). Those are superseded and kept for provenance and for the user feedback gathered on them. Use the main model directories at the root.

