# facilities

Facility and membership layers for Brazilian soft-commodity supply chains: one
unified layer plus the six component layers it is built from. All geometry is
WGS84 (EPSG:4326).

Part of
[Soft Commodity Infrastructure (Brazil)](https://data.source.coop/tristangruppwri/soft-commodity-infrastructure/README.md).

![Facility locations over Brazil](https://data.source.coop/tristangruppwri/soft-commodity-infrastructure/facilities/thumbnail.png)

## The files

| Asset | Rows | Size | What it is |
|---|---:|---:|---|
| [`BR_facilities`](https://data.source.coop/tristangruppwri/soft-commodity-infrastructure/facilities/BR_facilities.parquet) | 40,669 | 4.9 MB | The unified layer, every entity as one row across all five tiers. **Start here.** |
| [`BR_intake_points`](https://data.source.coop/tristangruppwri/soft-commodity-infrastructure/facilities/BR_intake_points.parquet) | 18,802 | 1.2 MB | Grain silos from CONAB: cooperative, trader and official, registered coordinates, capacity in tonnes |
| [`BR_sisbi_points`](https://data.source.coop/tristangruppwri/soft-commodity-infrastructure/facilities/BR_sisbi_points.parquet) | 11,582 | 598 KB | State and municipal slaughterhouses and dairy plants, via Trase, with `inspection_level` (SIE/SIM/CONSORCIO) |
| [`BR_muni`](https://data.source.coop/tristangruppwri/soft-commodity-infrastructure/facilities/BR_muni.parquet) | 5,570 | 3.6 MB | IBGE municipality boundaries, the geography everything keys to |
| [`BR_membership_muni`](https://data.source.coop/tristangruppwri/soft-commodity-infrastructure/facilities/BR_membership_muni.parquet) | 5,257 | 3.4 MB | Cooperative-member farm counts per município (IBGE Censo Agropecuário 2017) |
| [`BR_buyer_points`](https://data.source.coop/tristangruppwri/soft-commodity-infrastructure/facilities/BR_buyer_points.parquet) | 1,514 | 122 KB | Federally inspected (SIF) slaughterhouses and dairy plants, geocoded |
| [`BR_mill_points`](https://data.source.coop/tristangruppwri/soft-commodity-infrastructure/facilities/BR_mill_points.parquet) | 417 | 27 KB | Sugar and ethanol mills from ANP, at municipality centroids |

83,811 rows across the seven files, describing 40,669 distinct entities.
`BR_facilities` is a union of the other six plus 3,103 modelled catchment
polygons, so the counts overlap. Sizes and SHA-256 checksums for every file are
in
[collection.json](https://data.source.coop/tristangruppwri/soft-commodity-infrastructure/facilities/collection.json).

## Tiers, in `BR_facilities.tier`

| `tier` | Rows | Geometry | |
|---|---:|---|---|
| `intake_point` | 18,796 | Point | grain silos |
| `slaughter_point` | 13,096 | Point | animal-product buyers, SIF plus SISBI |
| `membership_muni` | 5,257 | Polygon / MultiPolygon | cooperative-member density |
| `gravity_catchment` | 3,103 | Polygon | modelled silo draw-areas, the only `modelled` rows |
| `mill_point` | 417 | Point | sugar and ethanol mills |

## Quick start

DuckDB reads these files over HTTPS with no download and no credentials.

```sql
INSTALL spatial; LOAD spatial; INSTALL httpfs; LOAD httpfs;

SELECT tier, count(*) AS n
FROM 'https://data.source.coop/tristangruppwri/soft-commodity-infrastructure/facilities/BR_facilities.parquet'
GROUP BY tier
ORDER BY n DESC;
```

Which federally inspected plants sit inside Sorriso, Mato Grosso:

```sql
SELECT b.razao_social, b.commodity, b.capacity_band
FROM 'https://data.source.coop/tristangruppwri/soft-commodity-infrastructure/facilities/BR_buyer_points.parquet' b
JOIN 'https://data.source.coop/tristangruppwri/soft-commodity-infrastructure/facilities/BR_muni.parquet' u
  ON ST_Within(b.geometry, u.geometry)
WHERE u.cod_ibge = '5107925';
```

```
               razao_social commodity capacity_band
FRIGORIFICO NUTRIBRAS S. A.      pork        gt80_h
     MAROMBI ALIMENTOS LTDA   poultry       unknown
```

Cooperative membership by state:

```sql
SELECT uf, sum(coop_members) AS members, count(*) AS munis
FROM 'https://data.source.coop/tristangruppwri/soft-commodity-infrastructure/facilities/BR_membership_muni.parquet'
GROUP BY uf
ORDER BY members DESC
LIMIT 5;
```

```
uf  members  munis
RS 143481.0    494
PR 106440.0    397
MG  92368.0    824
SC  63842.0    294
SP  45753.0    620
```

`geometry` arrives already typed as `GEOMETRY('OGC:CRS84')`. Do not wrap it in
`ST_GeomFromWKB` — that raises a binder error. The traps that produce quietly
wrong answers rather than errors are listed in
[AGENTS.md](https://data.source.coop/tristangruppwri/soft-commodity-infrastructure/facilities/AGENTS.md).

## Trust labels

`basis`: `observed` 37,566 rows, `modelled` 3,103 rows (the gravity catchments
only).

`geom_method`: `registered` 18,796, `geocoded` 12,007, `municipality` 5,257,
`derived` 3,103, `municipality_centroid` 1,506.

## Schema

Column lists differ per file and are declared per asset in
[collection.json](https://data.source.coop/tristangruppwri/soft-commodity-infrastructure/facilities/collection.json)
under `table:columns`. The unified layer carries eight columns:

| Column | Type | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| `entity_id` | string | Identifier within the source registry. Not unique, and the namespace changes with `tier` |
| `entity_kind` | string | `cooperative`, `trader`, `official`, `buyer`, or `mill` |
| `tier` | string | `intake_point`, `slaughter_point`, `mill_point`, `membership_muni`, or `gravity_catchment` |
| `weight` | double | Size measure. Unit depends on `tier` |
| `basis` | string | `observed` or `modelled` |
| `geom_method` | string | How the coordinate was set |
| `source` | string | `CONAB`, `MAPA-SIF`, `Trase-SISBI`, `ANP`, or `IBGE-6848` |
| `geometry` | WKB | Point, Polygon or MultiPolygon, WGS84 |

## Coverage

Bounding box, measured over the geometries rather than copied:
`[-73.9904, -33.7508, -29.2990, 5.2718]`.

Temporal extent `2017-01-01` to `2026-07-23`. The start is the vintage of the
oldest source, the IBGE Censo Agropecuário 2017. The end is when this snapshot
was compiled. Neither is a per-row date; the files carry no date column.

## Known issues

- Geocoded and municipality-centroid points are approximate. A geocode can land
  on the wrong lot; a centroid sits at the middle of the town.
- Cooperative membership is a per-município count, not a named cooperative.
  313 of the 5,570 municipalities carry no membership row.
- One `cod_ibge` in `BR_intake_points` matches no municipality in `BR_muni`.
- Three municipality polygons fail an OGC validity test. They are published
  unrepaired, as received from IBGE.
- Rice, cotton, and coffee are not covered. No authoritative open geolocated
  source exists for them.
- CONAB's registry drifts daily. Exact source snapshot dates are recorded in
  [github.com/wri/rural-land](https://github.com/wri/rural-land).

